---
// Session-scoped entry sequence: the ELDEN wordmark draws itself in as line
// art — each letterform's outline traces on, left to right, then fills
// solid with its real brand color — while a progress bar and counter along
// the bottom edge run the SAME clock, so the number reaching 100 and the
// mark finishing its fill are the same event read two ways, not two
// animations that happen to end together. Holds a beat, then both fade
// away to reveal the page.
//
// Path data is the same nine shapes as src/assets/logo.svg (the real
// navbar/hero mark), copied in rather than imported as an <img> — an
// outline-draw animation needs to address each letterform as its own SVG
// <path> and call getTotalLength() on it, which isn't possible through an
// <img>. src/components/Logo.astro already duplicates this same geometry
// for its own (single-color) purposes; same tradeoff, same reason. Keep
// both in sync with logo.svg if the mark itself ever changes.
//
// It does not touch the hero. When it clears it dispatches `elden:intro`;
// the hero owns its own reveal and listens for that. When the preloader is
// skipped the event fires immediately, so the hero behaves the same either
// way.
//
// Whether it plays at all is decided by the inline head script in
// Base.astro, before first paint — see the comment there. This component
// only reads the resulting `data-preloading` flag; it never re-decides, or
// the two could disagree.
//
// Accessibility contract:
//   - display:none unless <html data-preloading> is set, so no-JS and
//     reduced-motion users never see a stuck cream screen
//   - contains nothing focusable, so it cannot trap the keyboard
//   - aria-hidden: decoration over content that is already in the DOM
---

<div id="preloader" aria-hidden="true" class="fixed inset-0 bg-ink" style="z-index: var(--z-preloader)">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center px-[24px]">
    <svg
      id="preloader-mark"
      viewBox="0 0 618 71"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Elden"
      class="h-auto w-[240px] sm:w-[320px] md:w-[420px]"
      style="transform-origin: center;"
    >
      <path fill="#38c467" stroke="#38c467" d="M 5.25 4.24 C 6.69 3.41 8.42 3.58 10.01 3.51 C 41.34 3.56 72.66 3.52 103.98 3.53 C 106.22 3.38 108.63 4.25 109.78 6.28 C 112.39 10.36 109.53 17.59 104.14 17.04 C 74.77 17.16 45.39 16.99 16.01 17.13 C 12.58 17.00 8.90 17.73 5.66 16.25 C 1.72 13.71 0.54 6.69 5.25 4.24 Z"></path>
